1
00:01:50,435 --> 00:01:52,435


2
00:01:52,459 --> 00:01:55,760
Queen Icicle of Coolland was a cold-hearted woman.

3
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:59,782
They sent a fake Sapphire to take over Silverland,

4
00:01:59,806 --> 00:02:03,300
leaving the real Sapphire unable to even enter the castle.

5
00:02:04,774 --> 00:02:06,940
Meanwhile, the Coolland army finally mobilizes.

6
00:02:07,434 --> 00:02:11,080
With their new weapon, the Iron Lion, they surge toward the border for battle.

7
00:02:11,860 --> 00:02:15,195
All by themselves, Sapphire and Tink defeated the Iron Lion

8
00:02:15,219 --> 00:02:17,760
and crushed the massive enemy army.

9
00:02:18,575 --> 00:02:21,240
But Tink had disappeared.

10
00:02:21,764 --> 00:02:23,220
Sapphire was at a loss.

11
00:02:24,124 --> 00:02:26,040
That's when Hecate arrived.

12
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:31,454
They say Mephisto is about to smash the petrified King and Queen

13
00:02:31,479 --> 00:02:33,280
on Sea Snake Island!

14
00:02:36,315 --> 00:02:38,660
This week's story begins here.

15
00:02:39,099 --> 00:02:40,666
Please sit back and enjoy the show.

16
00:02:49,934 --> 00:02:51,015
Oh... 

17
00:02:51,039 --> 00:02:52,502
how awful... 

18
00:02:52,526 --> 00:02:53,949
how terrible... 

19
00:02:53,973 --> 00:02:55,326
How could this happen...

20
00:02:58,246 --> 00:02:59,735
What a terrifying queen... 

21
00:03:00,666 --> 00:03:02,080
What are you waiting for?!

22
00:03:02,295 --> 00:03:04,000
Build the second Iron Lion right away!

23
00:03:04,170 --> 00:03:06,160
Send a messenger to Crystal Valley!

24
00:03:07,060 --> 00:03:08,542
How terrifying...

25
00:03:08,566 --> 00:03:10,262
The Queen who ordered a weapon like this...

26
00:03:10,286 --> 00:03:11,780
She's a terrifying woman...

27
00:03:14,470 --> 00:03:15,820
Seize that young man!

28
00:03:15,920 --> 00:03:17,580
For the crime of speaking ill of the Queen!

29
00:03:26,469 --> 00:03:27,226
I fell...

30
00:03:28,590 --> 00:03:31,020
Getting buried under the dirt saved me.

31
00:03:31,404 --> 00:03:32,786
Sapphire must be worried...

32
00:03:34,609 --> 00:03:35,900
Sapphire!

33
00:03:36,100 --> 00:03:37,800
Sapphire!

34
00:03:39,870 --> 00:03:41,720
Where'd you go, Sapphire?

35
00:03:41,875 --> 00:03:43,120
Let's ask Tori-san and the others!

36
00:03:44,240 --> 00:03:45,713
Hey, guys!

37
00:03:59,093 --> 00:03:59,826
Sapphire!

38
00:03:59,894 --> 00:04:00,840
Welcome!

39
00:04:01,580 --> 00:04:02,580
Come on, Mephisto!

40
00:04:03,060 --> 00:04:04,420
I came here of my own free will!

41
00:04:04,679 --> 00:04:06,106
Please save my parents!

42
00:04:06,674 --> 00:04:07,400
Very well!

43
00:04:07,524 --> 00:04:09,420
As long as you swear never to run away!

44
00:04:09,880 --> 00:04:10,353
I won't run!

45
00:04:10,575 --> 00:04:11,860
I swear on this sword, I won't run!

46
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:12,553
So hurry!

47
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:14,260
Very well!

48
00:04:16,640 --> 00:04:18,553
Zuborosha!

49
00:04:28,520 --> 00:04:29,066
My King!

50
00:04:29,091 --> 00:04:30,100
Are you safe?

51
00:04:30,125 --> 00:04:31,150
Father!

52
00:04:31,793 --> 00:04:32,846
Mother!

53
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:34,481
I could swear I heard Sapphire's voice... 

54
00:04:34,505 --> 00:04:35,659
Yes, I heard it too!

55
00:04:38,560 --> 00:04:40,333
Uraisha!

56
00:04:45,015 --> 00:04:48,020
Papa, aren't you going to send Sapphire's parents back?

57
00:04:48,780 --> 00:04:49,780
Leave them be!

58
00:04:49,840 --> 00:04:51,419
Who cares about humans!

59
00:04:51,825 --> 00:04:52,825
How terrible!

60
00:04:52,900 --> 00:04:54,993
Then those people will starve to death!

61
00:04:55,405 --> 00:04:56,765
Shut up!

62
00:05:15,606 --> 00:05:17,280
There's humans among the Sea Serpent People!

63
00:05:17,720 --> 00:05:18,720
A sea serpent man?

64
00:05:21,061 --> 00:05:25,720
Look... The ones on the island are the King and Queen of Silverland!

65
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:27,686
Capture them!

66
00:05:27,875 --> 00:05:29,620
Dispatch a ship at once!

67
00:05:30,080 --> 00:05:30,553
Yes!

68
00:05:37,456 --> 00:05:37,976
Freeze!

69
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:38,444
Don't move!

70
00:05:38,469 --> 00:05:39,196
You're under arrest!

71
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:40,586
What are you doing?!

72
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:42,300
We are not suspicious people!

73
00:05:53,226 --> 00:05:54,226
Hecate!

74
00:05:58,760 --> 00:06:00,640
Tonight, you will be reborn!

75
00:06:00,925 --> 00:06:03,479
Into a fearless witch with a strong heart!

76
00:06:04,050 --> 00:06:06,140
It is the long-awaited, thrilling moment!

77
00:06:10,760 --> 00:06:13,700
Storm, howl to celebrate the birth of a witch!

78
00:06:13,793 --> 00:06:14,200
Shriek!

79
00:06:14,520 --> 00:06:15,380
Cry out!

80
00:06:24,160 --> 00:06:25,220
Just a little more!

81
00:06:25,245 --> 00:06:25,636
Tired?

82
00:06:25,660 --> 00:06:26,660
Keep going!

83
00:06:34,070 --> 00:06:35,536
Don't give up!

84
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:48,720
My hands are going numb!

85
00:06:51,360 --> 00:06:52,360
You demon!

86
00:06:52,440 --> 00:06:53,700
Get away!

87
00:06:59,620 --> 00:07:00,620
Papa!

88
00:07:07,033 --> 00:07:07,800
Sapphire!

89
00:07:12,320 --> 00:07:13,115
Tink!

90
00:07:13,140 --> 00:07:14,140
You're alive?

91
00:07:14,229 --> 00:07:15,020
I sure am!

92
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:16,040
Of course!

93
00:07:16,405 --> 00:07:17,405
See?

94
00:07:32,793 --> 00:07:33,360
Look!

95
00:07:33,390 --> 00:07:35,066
That's Sea Snake Island!

96
00:07:40,900 --> 00:07:42,466
There's no one here...

97
00:07:42,490 --> 00:07:44,920
So Mephisto really did send Father and the others back!

98
00:07:45,145 --> 00:07:48,013
I doubt a demon could be that kind...

99
00:07:48,037 --> 00:07:50,206
Either way, I'm heading back to Silverland!

100
00:08:03,290 --> 00:08:05,700
The Sand Glass migratory birds are crossing the sea!

101
00:08:16,105 --> 00:08:17,913
Thank you, birds!

102
00:08:17,940 --> 00:08:19,500
Come back soon!

103
00:08:21,939 --> 00:08:22,480
Tink!

104
00:08:22,880 --> 00:08:23,526
Over here!

105
00:08:26,990 --> 00:08:28,340
Here's the entrance to the secret passage!

106
00:08:29,370 --> 00:08:31,126
Why are we going in through the secret passage?

107
00:08:31,340 --> 00:08:32,686
I told you so!

108
00:08:32,915 --> 00:08:35,440
There's an impostor of me inside the castle!

109
00:08:35,590 --> 00:08:37,620
We'll be in big trouble if we get kicked out like this!

110
00:08:38,779 --> 00:08:40,500
Going left leads to the Cave Hall... It's impossible!

111
00:08:40,501 --> 00:08:41,720
To the right!

112
00:08:43,304 --> 00:08:45,420
This one moves!

113
00:08:54,171 --> 00:08:55,171
Be careful!

114
00:08:55,195 --> 00:08:56,740
There's an old well over there!

115
00:08:57,525 --> 00:08:58,953
Ugh, how creepy...

116
00:09:07,499 --> 00:09:08,980
Someone's coming this way!

117
00:09:14,410 --> 00:09:16,175
You! Somebody, get over here!

118
00:09:16,200 --> 00:09:17,646
He's not coming!

119
00:09:20,409 --> 00:09:21,580
How dare you!

120
00:09:29,169 --> 00:09:30,500
He's dead...

121
00:09:34,439 --> 00:09:35,740
This is my room!

122
00:09:37,749 --> 00:09:39,800
We're safe now that we've made it this far!

123
00:09:43,089 --> 00:09:44,360
Don't panic!

124
00:09:44,510 --> 00:09:45,510
Mr. Are!

125
00:09:45,720 --> 00:09:47,493
Oh, it's just Taka-kun.

126
00:09:47,690 --> 00:09:48,700
Where'd you come from?

127
00:09:48,970 --> 00:09:49,980
Come over here!

128
00:09:52,490 --> 00:09:53,600
Oof, so heavy!

129
00:09:55,706 --> 00:09:56,520
It's a letter!

130
00:09:58,860 --> 00:09:59,860
What's wrong?

131
00:10:00,309 --> 00:10:02,500
Father and the others were captured at the Snow Castle!

132
00:10:02,980 --> 00:10:04,960
What on earth happened?

133
00:10:05,490 --> 00:10:09,180
Fortunately, we captured the King and Queen of Silverland.

134
00:10:09,905 --> 00:10:10,826
It's true...

135
00:10:18,750 --> 00:10:22,280
This is all according to Her Majesty's wishes.

136
00:10:22,685 --> 00:10:25,011
Tomorrow, Her Majesty will send a message

137
00:10:25,035 --> 00:10:27,420
demanding Silverland's surrender.

138
00:10:27,820 --> 00:10:31,751
You will go to Coolland Castle posing as Sapphire,

139
00:10:31,775 --> 00:10:35,060
and seal the document as proof of surrender.

140
00:10:37,899 --> 00:10:39,720
I could never do that!

141
00:10:40,899 --> 00:10:44,400
But if you don't surrender, the King and Queen will be in danger!

142
00:10:44,969 --> 00:10:47,026
Then what am I supposed to do?

143
00:10:48,010 --> 00:10:49,811
How can I save Father and Mother 

144
00:10:49,835 --> 00:10:51,780
without having our kingdom surrender?

145
00:10:52,355 --> 00:10:54,951
I don't know either...

146
00:10:54,975 --> 00:10:58,100
but as long as we defeat the Snow Queen, nobody can complain.

147
00:10:59,440 --> 00:11:00,440
The Snow Queen?

148
00:11:00,660 --> 00:11:01,020
Yeah.

149
00:11:01,449 --> 00:11:04,526
But no matter how strong Sapphire is, that's impossible.

150
00:11:04,929 --> 00:11:07,206
The Queen is surrounded by soldiers.

151
00:11:07,693 --> 00:11:08,395
Tink!

152
00:11:08,420 --> 00:11:09,100
What?

153
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:09,980
It's not impossible!

154
00:11:10,120 --> 00:11:11,640
It'll be easy for me now!

155
00:11:11,865 --> 00:11:14,646
I just need to pose as the fake Sapphire and go see the Queen!

156
00:11:20,333 --> 00:11:21,566
What should I do?

157
00:11:22,905 --> 00:11:26,377
Oh no... It'll be terrible if Sapphire dies...

158
00:11:26,414 --> 00:11:28,906
Isn't there some way to deal with this?

159
00:11:30,329 --> 00:11:32,550
Taka-kun went home...

160
00:11:33,360 --> 00:11:34,521
Oh, I know!

161
00:11:34,875 --> 00:11:36,859
I'll ask Peter in the forest!

162
00:11:39,280 --> 00:11:40,420
Peter!

163
00:11:41,800 --> 00:11:42,600
Hey!

164
00:11:42,650 --> 00:11:43,989
Peter!

165
00:11:45,500 --> 00:11:46,100
Hey!

166
00:11:46,265 --> 00:11:47,265
Good evening, Peter-kun!

167
00:11:47,735 --> 00:11:49,080
I have a favor to ask!

168
00:11:50,390 --> 00:11:51,080
Please!

169
00:11:51,300 --> 00:11:52,360
The Underwater Valley!

170
00:11:55,520 --> 00:11:56,660
Underwater Valley!

171
00:11:56,804 --> 00:11:59,320
There are plenty of allies for Sapphire there!

172
00:11:59,869 --> 00:12:01,960
Even when I was captured, Sapphire...

173
00:12:05,649 --> 00:12:07,460
Everyone was so nice to me.

174
00:12:08,295 --> 00:12:10,260
There isn't a single bad person there.

175
00:12:15,889 --> 00:12:17,466
They opposed the Snow Queen.

176
00:12:18,060 --> 00:12:20,613
They got thrown in a place like that just for that!

177
00:12:25,689 --> 00:12:27,593
We've got to get them out of there!

178
00:12:31,413 --> 00:12:34,613
Then I'm sure they'll support Sapphire!

179
00:12:44,170 --> 00:12:47,259
Use your instincts to find the field mouse's hole!

180
00:13:02,379 --> 00:13:03,459
Is Nezumi in here?

181
00:13:05,280 --> 00:13:06,520
Goodbye!

182
00:13:10,160 --> 00:13:10,780
Good morning!

183
00:13:16,981 --> 00:13:20,073
Say, can I ask you guys a favor?

184
00:13:20,900 --> 00:13:21,900
Locked 'em tight!

185
00:13:26,620 --> 00:13:27,620
Now get out!

186
00:13:27,835 --> 00:13:29,953
Starting today, you bastards work in this valley!

187
00:13:30,441 --> 00:13:31,620
Get going!

188
00:13:31,915 --> 00:13:33,066
Just you wait!

189
00:13:33,600 --> 00:13:34,999
I wonder how Sapphire is doing.

190
00:13:35,625 --> 00:13:37,719
The Queen's messenger must be following us!

191
00:13:51,689 --> 00:13:53,480
I'm counting on you, Fake Sapphire!

192
00:13:54,180 --> 00:13:56,800
That Nylon thinks I'm a fake!

193
00:13:57,065 --> 00:13:58,860
Whew!

194
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:12,000
Hey!

195
00:14:16,030 --> 00:14:17,720
You can drop the mask now!

196
00:14:19,660 --> 00:14:21,120
Lord Freeze will be pleased, too!

197
00:14:21,555 --> 00:14:23,540
That fake princess puts on quite an act!

198
00:14:24,020 --> 00:14:24,700
But still!

199
00:14:24,785 --> 00:14:25,800
Then it's just the two of us!

200
00:14:26,065 --> 00:14:27,700
Go back to your normal self and talk!

201
00:14:29,200 --> 00:14:30,740
I don't even know that man's name.

202
00:14:31,090 --> 00:14:32,360
How can I fool them?

203
00:14:33,080 --> 00:14:33,460
Hey!

204
00:14:33,680 --> 00:14:34,680
Why are you staying quiet?!

205
00:14:34,720 --> 00:14:35,720
You miserable fool!

206
00:14:36,180 --> 00:14:37,180
Eek!

207
00:14:37,630 --> 00:14:38,630
He's all yours!

208
00:14:38,960 --> 00:14:41,960
If I talk like I usually do, Lady Freeze will chew me out!

209
00:14:42,645 --> 00:14:44,820
So I'm not talking to you!

210
00:14:44,925 --> 00:14:45,680
Do you understand?

211
00:14:45,780 --> 00:14:46,380
I get it!

212
00:14:46,635 --> 00:14:48,520
Because Lady Freeze is terrifying!

213
00:15:14,820 --> 00:15:16,220
Ah!

214
00:15:16,835 --> 00:15:17,835
She's back!

215
00:15:22,120 --> 00:15:23,520
Ah!

216
00:15:23,520 --> 00:15:24,520
She's back!

217
00:15:30,215 --> 00:15:31,940
We're almost at Coolland Castle.

218
00:15:32,505 --> 00:15:36,021
Whether we can make it out alive... No!

219
00:15:36,195 --> 00:15:39,040
I'll never save Father and the others if I'm this weak-minded!

220
00:15:39,845 --> 00:15:42,500
I must become much, much stronger...

221
00:16:03,800 --> 00:16:05,340
What are you dawdling for?!

222
00:16:05,940 --> 00:16:07,360
Just a little more to the tunnel!

223
00:16:07,640 --> 00:16:09,000
Then it's straight to the castle!

224
00:16:09,360 --> 00:16:09,840
Keep going!

225
00:16:09,940 --> 00:16:10,940
Push!

226
00:16:13,580 --> 00:16:14,100
Hey!

227
00:16:14,240 --> 00:16:14,680
You bastard!

228
00:16:14,820 --> 00:16:16,000
Don't slack off!

229
00:16:17,489 --> 00:16:19,020
Get back to work!

230
00:16:23,540 --> 00:16:29,921
Heave... ho... heave... ho... Great!

231
00:16:33,500 --> 00:16:33,980
Ah!

232
00:16:34,420 --> 00:16:35,420
Mice!

233
00:16:35,680 --> 00:16:37,600
I'm terrified of mice!

234
00:16:37,720 --> 00:16:38,720
Help me!

235
00:16:42,069 --> 00:16:43,300
Help me!

236
00:16:44,400 --> 00:16:45,560
I found a mouse!

237
00:16:45,561 --> 00:16:46,561
I'll turn into a mouse!

238
00:16:47,260 --> 00:16:47,620
Hey!

239
00:16:47,740 --> 00:16:48,740
Hey!

240
00:16:55,559 --> 00:16:59,360
Go, little mice, go!

241
00:16:59,835 --> 00:17:01,680
Tear apart those pulling us!

242
00:17:04,020 --> 00:17:04,380
Ah!

243
00:17:04,500 --> 00:17:05,500
So scary!

244
00:17:09,900 --> 00:17:10,260
Ah!

245
00:17:10,300 --> 00:17:11,119
I'm so happy!

246
00:17:11,300 --> 00:17:12,099
We're free!

247
00:17:12,100 --> 00:17:12,560
Ah!

248
00:17:12,920 --> 00:17:13,940
We're saved!

249
00:17:16,140 --> 00:17:18,420
Little mouse, little mouse...

250
00:17:21,720 --> 00:17:22,720
Please!

251
00:17:22,849 --> 00:17:26,460
Cheer on Sapphire, and let me defeat the Snow Queen!

252
00:17:47,989 --> 00:17:49,940
They still think I'm an impostor.

253
00:17:50,374 --> 00:17:52,260
Good work, fake Sapphire.

254
00:17:52,699 --> 00:17:54,000
Yes, thank you, sir.

255
00:17:54,264 --> 00:17:57,960
Everyone in this room knows you're the fake Sapphire.

256
00:17:58,080 --> 00:17:59,560
Make yourself comfortable and relax.

257
00:17:59,800 --> 00:17:59,960
Yes.

258
00:18:00,254 --> 00:18:05,480
Once you stamp your seal here, Silverland will be mine. But before that, Your Majesty!

259
00:18:07,260 --> 00:18:07,900
What is it?

260
00:18:08,164 --> 00:18:11,040
Are the King and Queen really imprisoned?

261
00:18:11,270 --> 00:18:12,080
Is Duke Duralumin weeping?

262
00:18:12,081 --> 00:18:15,180
The Queen was terribly worried and wanted me to make sure...

263
00:18:16,149 --> 00:18:17,760
What a faint-hearted man.

264
00:18:18,334 --> 00:18:20,160
Then let me show you the two of them.

265
00:18:23,280 --> 00:18:24,280
Come out.

266
00:18:46,580 --> 00:18:47,360
Sapphire!

267
00:18:47,569 --> 00:18:49,200
Isn't that Sapphire?

268
00:18:49,989 --> 00:18:51,540
What foolish people.

269
00:18:52,139 --> 00:18:54,620
This isn't your daughter.

270
00:18:54,774 --> 00:18:56,821
Th-That's impossible... It must be Sapphire!

271
00:18:57,054 --> 00:19:02,661
Father, Mother, stay quiet... Take my hand!

272
00:19:02,754 --> 00:19:04,420
Yes, right away.

273
00:19:13,709 --> 00:19:14,720
What are you standing around for?

274
00:19:14,924 --> 00:19:16,920
If you value the Queen's life, open the cell!

275
00:19:17,080 --> 00:19:18,080
Yes, sir!

276
00:19:18,349 --> 00:19:24,320
So you really are...

277
00:19:26,149 --> 00:19:28,460
That's right, I'm the real Sapphire!

278
00:19:28,560 --> 00:19:29,560
W-What?!

279
00:19:30,459 --> 00:19:32,160
Now I'll show you my other face!

280
00:19:32,744 --> 00:19:34,060
Ah, Princess Knight!

281
00:19:34,220 --> 00:19:35,220
You're Princess Knight!

282
00:19:35,769 --> 00:19:36,769
Let me escape! / Let's run!

283
00:19:36,874 --> 00:19:38,760
Don't worry, I hold the Queen hostage!

284
00:19:38,925 --> 00:19:39,925
I'm sorry, Sapphire!

285
00:19:41,220 --> 00:19:41,680
